    "created_at": "2026-10-05T12:35:31Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-10-05T12:35:31Z",
    "body": "From code inspection this seems to match [Chromium](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/blink/renderer/core/html/html_image_element.cc;l=329), [WebKit](https://searchfox.org/wubkat/source/Source/WebCore/html/HTMLImageElement.cpp#444), and [Gecko](https://searchfox.org/firefox-main/source/dom/html/HTMLImageElement.cpp#267). The tests should be updated to match though.\r\n\r\nThe spec also expects `width` and `height` on `source` to be relevant mutations, but that seems to not be implemented either. This could be a follow-up though.",
