    "created_at": "2026-10-05T12:47:31Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-10-05T12:47:31Z",
    "body": "For Firefox, the test results can be explained by lack of \"maybe omit events\" for layout changes.\r\n\r\nFor Safari TP, they can be explained by the same URL being used for all images and it's cached and used by lazy images (but results are flaky).\r\n\r\nTo fix the test, update the test expectation for \"width attribute changes\" to 'timeout', and add a different query string for each image.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
